    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6573f777f0bb414aa5e537",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们就这样定下了今后的方向，\n但因为也在意曼城茶座\n出赛“天皇赏（春）”后的身体状况──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0060747bd9058e87ddcab65fe84c4ae8b7a14c55a8b4f384c428fc229266b932",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
