      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是决定先保留国内目标“宝冢纪念”。\n至于是否前往法国远征，\n则等到下个月中旬再做出决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de87fe10a62877c5307358a74b257636d67c76931a5ebd5ec67b10274d7687a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
